# Text changes in the other order: Goblin to Dragon comes first and finds no Goblin in Llanowar Elves' type line, and Elf
# to Goblin comes after it. Applying the later change would change what the earlier one does (it would find a Goblin), so
# the earlier depends on it and waits (CR 613.8a(b), 613.8b): Elf becomes Goblin, then Goblin becomes Dragon - a Dragon
# Druid, as in timestamp order the other way round (artificial-evolution-twice-composes-in-timestamp-order-goblin-then-dragon).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Island
Artificial Evolution
Artificial Evolution
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x14

